# Everything works without keys (Esri satellite imagery, keyless terrain and
# OpenStreetMap 3D buildings). Visitors can also paste their own Google key in
# the app's 3D MAP panel. Keys set here are built into the site for everyone,
# so restrict them to your domain at the provider.

# Google Maps Platform key with the Map Tiles API enabled → Photorealistic 3D Tiles.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Cesium ion token → Cesium World Terrain, and Google 3D Tiles through ion.
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=
